# Environment overrides used by `next dev` and `next start`. Committed to
# the repo intentionally. The Zoho URLs below are public form-submission
# endpoints — anyone with them can POST to the form, so add Captcha/email
# verification inside Zoho if abuse becomes an issue.
#
# Zoho Forms — public form URLs.
#
# COMPANY uses the legacy /htmlRecords/submit endpoint (string ending in
# /htmlRecords/submit) — kept untouched because the existing wiring works.
#
# BOOKINGS and SERVICE_REQUEST use the JSON XHR endpoint (`submitToZohoFormJson`)
# which appends /records to the form page URL itself. So these values are the
# PUBLIC FORM PAGE URL (no /htmlRecords/submit suffix). The htmlRecords endpoint
# silently drops records that don't include Zoho's hidden auto-default fields.
ZOHO_FORM_URL_COMPANY=https://forms.zohopublic.com/mahanacreations1/form/CompanyRegistration/formperma/KkBDGP2wu_RhsWYcMy3UE3LSQZmmZoqVYE496fTGbqc/htmlRecords/submit
ZOHO_FORM_URL_BOOKINGS=https://forms.zohopublic.in/NammaOffice/form/NammaofficeBookings/formperma/QIa1rblKgYBCNbY_1VI0JIIpwT9z67EMNquaaJhYZ0o
ZOHO_FORM_URL_SERVICE_REQUEST=https://forms.zohopublic.in/NammaOffice/form/ServiceRequestForm/formperma/LYJsPwGr52w4V0rU-YYQu-y6UhQz0HPrNzFgJNxVvZw
